  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_camp.png",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Ember-Touched)</em> at level 5; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You can make a campfire feel like a cathedral.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Hearth Dominion (1/Long Rest).</strong> Over 1 minute, you sanctify a fire or heat-source. Allies who rest within 30 feet regain an extra Hit Die, and they have advantage on saves against fear until their next long rest.</p>\n        <p><strong>BBTTCC Hook.</strong> Once per Turn, your faction may treat a single “Shelter / Rest” travel step as if the weather were one tier gentler (handled by the Weather engine / GM).</p>",
